# --- Dataset-derived outputs: never in a public repository -------------------------------------
# The image datasets are non-commercial / no-redistribution (docs/PHASE_3_VISUAL_ENGINE.md, 12a).
# No dataset image, embedding, per-image table or per-image prediction is committed; weights trained
# on them stay out until the licenses are checked. scripts/check_no_dataset_outputs.py enforces this.
artifacts/visual/private/
artifacts/visual/**/*.npz
artifacts/visual/**/*.parquet
**/embeddings/
*metadata*.parquet
*predictions*.parquet
*per_image*
*celeb*df*/
*Celeb*DF*/
*faceforensics*/
*FaceForensics*/

# --- Graph and Voice engines: weights, per-sample scores, local state (2026-10-08) -----------------
# Elliptic is CC BY-NC-ND 4.0; whether weights or per-transaction scores may be shared is an open
# owner decision (docs/design_decisions.md, "Terms findings"). Until then none of them is committed.
artifacts/**/*.pt
artifacts/**/*.npz
artifacts/graph/*xgboost*.json
artifacts/graph/results.json
artifacts/graph/results_phase1c_partial.json
artifacts/voice/phase2c_D_ssl_mean_only_P1_s42/
artifacts/voice/phase2c_test_scores/
artifacts/voice/_to_delete/
_to_delete/
*.wav
*.flac
*.mp3
*.ogg
*.sqlite
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
node_modules/
frontend/dist/

